190	     *  is no longer a draft is refused: to change an open claim, void it and add a new one. A claim
191	     *  another user's editor locks is refused; saving releases the user's own lock. A new date whose
192	     *  due-by, as a claim added on it would be fixed, falls inside a closed period is refused; the
193	     *  claim's own due-by stays as it was fixed. */
194	    @Transactional
195	    public Claim update(String sheetId, String user, long id, BigDecimal amount, LocalDate date, String note,
196	            String corrects, String ref, String tags) {
